# The prod image builds from the repo root - Docker reads this file instead of the root .dockerignore, because it sits
# beside the Dockerfile with its name. Everything is out except what the build copies: the workspace files, the shared
# packages and this app, without their installs and build output
*
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!packages/
!templates/nextjs-vetrina/
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.astro
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.env*
!**/.env*.example
